# Lua

- 4-space indent, single quotes, LF, no semicolons (see `.editorconfig`).
- Use `xi.*` enums (`xi.zone`, `xi.item`, `xi.ki`, `xi.questStatus`). Do not hardcode IDs when an enum exists.
- NPC/mob scripts: `---@type TNpcEntity` / `TMobEntity`, `local entity = {}`, `return entity`.
- Enums in `scripts/enum/` attach to `xi` and must not be `require`d.
- Match surrounding file style. Do not reformat unrelated Lua.
- Keep existing header notes. Add `!pos` on NPC headers when touching the file.
